  "text": "TUESDAY, JULY 7\nGood morning.\nNO ROUTINE YET\nBuild a routine from your shelf.\nAdd the products you use and Today will become your AM/PM checklist.\nAdd products\nShelf\nempty for now\nLet's build your cabinet.\nAdd what you already use. Scan a barcode, or add it by hand. We'll handle freshness and clashes.\nScan a barcode\nAdd by hand\nYou\nACCOUNT\nSigned in\nSign out\nSUBSCRIPTION\nManage subscription\nFree plan\n>\nYOUR ROUTINE\nYour plan\n>\nEdit the order\n>\nMORE ROUTINE\nRetinoid ramp\n>\nStreak & adherence\n>\nWeekly check-in\n>\nRecent changes\n>\nFOR YOU\nRecommendations\n>\nRecommendation preferences\n>\nSkin Notes\nMyth vs evidence, reviewed and claim-safe.\n>\nSECURITY\nApp lock\nRequire your phone's unlock to open the app and your photo timeline.\nEncrypted cloud backup\nOff by default. A separate choice. Photos stay on this phone until you turn it on.\nREMINDERS\nReminders & notifications\nTiered, capped, at times you choose. Quiet hours & lock-screen discretion.\n>\nPRIVACY & CONSENT\nMarketing emails\nOff by default. Opt in anytime.\nPhotos & the no-AI-score promise\n>\nWithdraw health-data consent\nRecords your withdrawal in the consent ledger and deletes your collected health data.\n>\nPOLICIES\nPrivacy policy\nWhat data we collect, use, and share.\n>\nConsumer health privacy\nConsumer health data notice and rights.\n>\nTerms\nRules for using RoutineKind and subscription terms.\n>\nSupport\nHelp with accounts, billing, deletion, or export.\n>\nAccount deletion\nHow account deletion works before and after deleting in app.\n>\nData export\nHow to request and read your export.\n>\nYOUR DATA\nExport my data\nDelete account\nPhotos sta",
